Drop unused open crate dependency

The open crate is in Cargo.toml but no source uses it. Carrying an
unused dep widens supply-chain surface and pulls in transitive code
that has to be re-audited on every cargo update.

Plan: cargo rm open, verify build still passes. When external link
opening is wired (ParsedLink::External is parsed but not opened),
revisit with an explicit https/http-only allowlist and a confirm-
before-spawn step.